Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.78,0:01:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.66,0:01:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there we were falling like\Ncrazy. That's when Gomamon tells
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the fish in the river to swim\Nclose together and make a boat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for us later we find a beach\Nwith a whole bunch of these phone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,booths we tried calling home\Nbut none of them seemed to work
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.28,0:01:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next we got totally thrashed on\Nby showman he sprayed seawater
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like a fire hose my butt agumon\Ngot stepped on and that made him
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:02:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mad he digi balls into greymon\Nand gave showman a ride he won't
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.58,0:02:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forget then he turned back into\Nagumon dudes this place is wild
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.56,0:02:15.02,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Blue Wolf! Garurumon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've almost searched\Nthe whole island And we
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still haven't found any\Npeople Just some monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with attitude But they\Ncouldn't beat our Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friends Who can turn into\Nthese awesome fighters
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like when Agumon Digivolved\Ninto Greymon. And
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.94,0:02:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kicked Chuumon to the\Ncurb He was so cool Yo,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.74,0:02:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon! What's up, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.62,0:02:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like it when you're Greymon No offense,\Nbut why don't you just stay that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.96,0:02:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even superheroes need a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.18,0:02:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a monochromon, but\Ndon't worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a laid-back Digimon.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.77,0:03:05.74,Sign,Sign,0,180,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}MONOCHROMON
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.77,0:03:05.74,Sign,Sign,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.77,0:03:05.74,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Armored Dragon\N Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.77,0:03:05.74,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type\N Data
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.77,0:03:05.74,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack\N Volcano Strike
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although it is wise to be a bit\Ncautious with a monochromon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they do tend to get a bit\Nmiffed when they're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he must be starving,\Nbecause he looks really mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think he wants to eat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.26,0:03:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're caught between a\Nrock and two sets of teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something must have set\Nthose monochromon off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.72,0:03:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're fighting over territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.76,0:03:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can just have it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.35,0:03:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They definitely don't\Nneed us hanging around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,G .K., come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better hurry up, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay! We're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't walk this much\Nunless I'm at a mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as you can see,\Nwe're nowhere near one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, stop whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, my feet hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if you'd take off your boots\Nand socks, you'd feel better, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's much more practical, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not walking in dirt in my bare feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love the feel of dirt under my feet,\Nespecially between my toes. Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears that we may be\Nlosing our light source.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a weird sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole island is weird, and who\Nknows what will come out at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I detect water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay here while I check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, as usual, I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.30,0:04:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a lake with fresh, clean\Nwater and a variety of tasty fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect campsite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can finally\Nsoak my poor achy feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay, we get to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Mammon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.31,0:04:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better wait and make\Nsure it's safe first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I think we should keep\Nwalking and stop all the complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.12,0:04:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:04:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, that is a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that plan a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.46,0:05:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be safe to rest here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I love camping outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I won't walk in dirt, what\Nmakes you think I'll sleep in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, do you see a hotel here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.76,0:05:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a trolley car. That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lights just came on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe there are\Nsome real people in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.94,0:05:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.06,0:05:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they can take us back\Nhome in air-conditioned comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.10,0:05:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bummer, it's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totally empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No trolley cars this clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, goody, these cushions are comfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember those weird phone\Nbooths we saw on the beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something just as freaky\Ncould happen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.94,0:05:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like this suddenly\Nmoving all by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:05:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Possibly, but then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe that's how we're\Ngoing to get home So
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have nothing to lose\Nby staying here Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can we eat now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, I forgot
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Mammon, stop playing in the water
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't catch any fish if you\Nkeep on warning them away Yum,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yum, you can't get too\Nmany berries down the hatch
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.48,0:06:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, you better watch that\Nkiller breath of yours, Palmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those are bad mushrooms you shouldn't\Npick them they'll make you sick
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'd be a big mess without you palmon\Nyou're the best we're all set to cook
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dinner now all we need is the grub\Ngreat but how are we supposed to light
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.86,0:06:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the fire like this wow agumon you're
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the man oh hey look it we caught
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a bunch of fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Squirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.78,0:06:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where I wish we had a microwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too, because you're\Nabout to lose your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you use a stick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you come up with that, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.98,0:07:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is surprisingly\Ngood. Delicious. Matt,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.72,0:07:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom only lets me eat fish\Nsticks. I won't tell. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eat with my fingers tk\Nit's all right yeah you're
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hanging with the big boys\Nnow okay hey sora what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,matt doesn't treat tk like\Na brother only like he's a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.46,0:07:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bother is it just me or\Nhave you noticed that too
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah i wonder that's\Nstill learning to be a big
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.32,0:07:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brother maybe hey joe what\Nyou're looking at i'm trying
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to figure out which direction\Nwe've been going but
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the stars seem to be all\Nmixed up i haven't been
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,able to find the north star\Nanywhere i know i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,recognize any of these\Nconstellations you're forgetting
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your astronomy if you\Ncan't see the north star
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.36,0:07:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it must be on the\Nother side of the world do
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you think we could be in\Nthe southern hemisphere yes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:08:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i guess it's possible that\Nis if we're still on earth
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is that supposed to\Nmean look panamon's tired
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm getting really tired\Nmyself wait a second
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i think we should take\Nturns standing guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.28,0:08:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.19,0:08:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who wants to go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about if each of us stands\Nguard for about an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not TK. Oh, come on. Me too, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're too young\Nand you need your rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a warm blanket to help me sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gabumon. Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.36,0:08:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi may sneak up on\Nyou and steal your fur.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you feel a little tugged, it\Nmight be her about to cut your tail off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, Tai. That's not funny. Quit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you bugging about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon told you to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd both make great guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who goes first? I will. I'm next.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:09:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about if Izzy takes over after\Nthat and then I finish up the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I propose that the rest of us trek\Nback to the bus and get some shut-eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't sleep with all of you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit complaining,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.64,0:09:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's not perfect Just be glad we\Nhave a place to sleep That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi Good night Don't\Nlet the Monochromon bite
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for reminding me, TK
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My feet still hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is there a trolley here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's the aliens Maybe they knew we
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.66,0:09:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,needed it I hope I don't\Nget any monster cooties
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.08,0:09:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go over and lay down with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because your fur's making me sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.51,0:09:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you want me to keep T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.97,0:09:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just don't want to admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.60,0:09:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, you don't want to fall\Nasleep on your first night watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.82,0:10:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My eyes won't stay open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.84,0:10:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the lake and\Nsplash some water on my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I can handle this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm sorry about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to get so mad it's just\Nbeing here and having to watch TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.58,0:10:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you guys even live in the same house?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.06,0:10:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.24,0:10:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're half-brothers, and we\Ndon't get to see each other much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.02,0:10:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that explains a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt's a little strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.24,0:11:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe to a St.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bernard with a horn on his forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, watch out for the fire sparks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that horrible sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The trolley's starting to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's taking us home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's taking us toward that sea dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.02,0:12:40.98,Sign,Sign,0,180,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}SEADRAMON
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.02,0:12:40.98,Sign,Sign,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.02,0:12:40.98,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Aquatic\N Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.02,0:12:40.98,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type\N Data
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.02,0:12:40.98,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack\N Ice Arrow
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.73,0:12:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seadramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get eaten for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.04,0:12:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The land's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.06,0:12:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.89,0:12:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like we're on a monster longboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pulling us along by his tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even think he realizes we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.99,0:13:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a bit dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as he doesn't see\Nus, we should be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.84,0:13:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be too sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.26,0:13:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys jinxed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he knows we're here.\NWhat? I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.78,0:13:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess he does know we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.08,0:13:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, big red thing was his tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't my fault
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming back and he's not happy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.94,0:13:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash into the shore\NThis is really gonna mess up my hair
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.28,0:13:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, I'm just letting you know My\Nfur's gonna get wet and I'm gonna stink
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.77,0:14:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he left us right in the\Nmiddle of the lake I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suppose we could trick\Nhim into taking us back
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.02,0:14:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's attacking Come on you guys, let's\Nsend him back to the fishing No problem
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Viral twister
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.40,0:14:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please evade me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.32,0:14:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, Grey Wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been trying, but I can't\Nseem to do it this time, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe my body hasn't\Nrecovered from the last fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you can't help us, how\Nare we going to stop Seadramon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.22,0:14:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or the monster will get you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Gomamon! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.90,0:14:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out fast! It's Seadramon! He's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.24,0:14:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Mammon! You can do it! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.65,0:15:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, you awful water lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New blaster! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.24,0:15:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt was only trying to save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'll never forgive myself oh no this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.66,0:15:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is not good Seadramon may be a bubble
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brain but once he finds his prey
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he won't let go matt hang on Gatomon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please help him hit him with a bubble\Nboom cedramon's way too big i just
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't have enough power now Gabumon\Nyou're stronger how about You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.56,0:15:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt is in trouble, and I must help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.48,0:15:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.06,0:15:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find a way to save you,\Nbut the last thing I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand any of\Nthis, but I have to save Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a little stinky fur\Ncompared to a friend like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.46,0:16:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you go to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:16:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but where's Gabumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.70,0:17:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon's fur is legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's strong as steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's like a growling torpedo That's\Nastonishing, then he must be invincible Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.54,0:17:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's what I've heard anyway We'll soon\Nfind out I hope you're not exaggerating
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon With another one of your wild
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fishtails again He could\Nbe But I heard about it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tentomon's using his lethal ice blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howling blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gobble man flying sure a good way\Nto keep my fur dry you digivolved
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Into Garurumon just in time! Oh,\NGobble man, thanks for saving my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brother anytime little friend matt\Nyou were so awesome against that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monster you think so you know you\Nwere the man and you're the wolf man
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, very funny, but how\Nare we supposed to get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just watch
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.06,0:19:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, may I use you for a pillow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't take your fur Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.36,0:19:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there seems to be a pattern here This\Ntime only Gabumon could digivolve Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.82,0:19:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy's right Agumon was the\Nonly one who could do it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on! I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.02,0:19:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scream on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.46,0:19:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all beginning to make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon digivolved when I was\Nin danger. That has to be the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer. Our Digimon digivolves\Nwhen we're in trouble. Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that must be it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.22,0:19:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch it Is it\Ntime to go to the mall?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.78,0:19:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been here one day and I think\Nshe's put some muscle on her Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.86,0:19:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe if she puts in some effort She'll\Nbecome a hard-bodied machine like
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.94,0:20:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am I hope she grows pink wings just like\Nmy wings You must be kidding Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.44,0:20:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bro, you're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.80,0:21:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not all that you can see right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold, so it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.06,0:21:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a jacket for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.82,0:21:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dream that I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dream that I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The future of the rain is
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.98,0:23:05.00,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Red Hot! Birdramon!

